close-up of face and shoulders of Indian queen serving food in draped silk saree and temple jewellery, to seated brahmins, oil painting in the style of Raja Ravi Varma, rich pigments, soft chiaroscuro, reverent, ancient Puranic-era lamp lit courtyard feast of low carved-stone and timber buildings, clay-tile roofs, warm evening light, close-up of face and shoulders, eyes looking off-frame, shallow depth of field, a purely visual image, every surface plain and unmarked.